      "writtenOn": "2021-02-13T02:10:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this is already a blocking call (waitForResult).  Why not initialize on first read?\n\nMy understanding is that sim contact reading is done as a mass-import operation trigger by user request, so its likely if you split this into a initialize and a read op, they\u0027re both going to happen at the same time anyway.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 326,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 326,
        "endChar": 100
      },
      "revId": "a4921b15d2bc2227660b06eaba1b289d839de54c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
